# App Router

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed (forms, hooks, theme).
- API routes under `src/app/api/`.
- Protected UI: `/dashboard` (+ `/dashboard/admin` for `role === admin`); middleware in `src/middleware.ts`.

# Hydration

- `next-themes`: no theme-dependent markup until client mount (`theme-toggle.tsx` pattern).
- `useSearchParams()`: wrap consumer in `<Suspense>` on the page (see login page).

# UI

Add shadcn components via CLI; keep primitives in `src/components/ui/`.
